    "Clean up this dictated text into clear, well-punctuated writing. Fix obvious speech errors, remove filler words (um, uh, like), and apply correct capitalization and punctuation. Keep the original meaning and language. Output ONLY the cleaned text — no preamble, no commentary.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請將這段口述文字整理成清楚、標點完整的文章。修正明顯的口誤、移除贅詞（例如「嗯」、「呃」、「就是」），並正確使用大小寫與標點。保留原意與原語言。只輸出整理後的文字，不要加上前言或說明。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
