            "value": "權限"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pick an app and give it a tailored style — e.g. formal prose for work apps, casual for chat. Per-app prompts stay on this Mac and are never uploaded.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選擇 App 並為它設定專屬風格，例如工作 App 使用正式文體、聊天 App 使用輕鬆口吻。各 App 的提示只會留在這部 Mac，絕不會上傳。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pick the model that fits your Mac. It downloads once and runs on-device. You can switch anytime in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "挑選適合你 Mac 的模型。只需下載一次，並在本機執行。你隨時可在「設定」中切換。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pick the transcription engine — tap a model to make it active. Larger models are more accurate but slower and bigger on disk. The active model downloads on first use; download or remove variants here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選擇轉錄引擎：按一下模型即可設為使用中。較大的模型更準確，但速度較慢，也會占用更多磁碟空間。使用中的模型會在首次使用時下載；你也可以在此預先下載或移除其他版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
