            "state": "translated",
            "value": "移除第 %lld 項適用於 %@ 的詞語取代規則"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Removes background noise before transcription. Auto only cleans clips it detects as noisy, and downloads a small model on first use. Manage the denoiser in Advanced; compare Off / Auto / On in Benchmark.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在轉錄前移除背景噪音。「自動」只清理偵測到有噪音的片段，並於首次使用時下載小型模型。你可以在「進階」中管理降噪器，並在「基準測試」中比較「關閉」、「自動」與「開啟」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Removing…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "移除中…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Replacements run last — after Chinese conversion and spacing — and the longest matching term wins. Write terms the way the text looks after those steps; use the Preview below to check. Longer, distinctive terms are safer; very short terms can fire inside unrelated words.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "詞語取代會在最後執行，也就是中文轉換與間距調整之後；最長的相符詞優先。請依照完成前述處理後的文字填寫詞語，並使用下方「預覽」確認。較長且具辨識度的詞語較安全；太短的詞語可能在不相關的文字中誤觸。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
