    "Speak anywhere on your Mac and ThinkAloud turns it into text — instantly, and entirely on-device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Mac 上任何地方說話，ThinkAloud 立即在本機把它轉成文字。"
