            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App 將恢復使用預設潤飾風格。此操作無法復原。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The audio file is missing: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "找不到音訊檔：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The audio is clipping (too loud) — cleaning is forced. Move back from the mic or lower the input level.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "音訊發生削峰（音量過大），因此會強制清理。請離麥克風遠一點，或調低輸入音量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The audio path is invalid: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "音訊路徑無效：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The benchmark couldn’t finish. Verify the selected model and saved audio files, then retry.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "基準測試無法完成。請確認所選模型與已儲存的音訊檔後再試一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The benchmark model couldn’t be prepared. Check Model settings, available storage, and your connection, then retry.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法準備基準測試所用的模型。請檢查「模型」設定、可用儲存空間與網路連線後再試一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The clip was too short to judge. Record a couple of seconds.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "錄音太短，無法判斷。請錄製幾秒鐘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The commit succeeded, but temporary local files remain at %@. Remove this folder manually.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提交成功，但本機暫存檔仍留在 %@。請手動移除此檔案夾。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The database operation reported %@, and its resulting row state could not be read: %@": {
      "localizations": {
