            "value": "已儲存的逐字稿編輯設定無效。請重設後再試一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected %@ model is not downloaded. Benchmark will download approximately %@, then load it into memory before processing records.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "The selected %1$@ model is not downloaded. Benchmark will download approximately %2$@, then load it into memory before processing records."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所選 %@ 模型尚未下載。基準測試會先下載約 %@，接著載入記憶體，再處理紀錄。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The speech model could not process this recording. Verify the model, then run the benchmark again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "語音模型無法處理這段錄音。請確認模型後再次執行基準測試。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The speech model couldn’t transcribe this recording. Verify that the selected model is downloaded and ready, then record again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "語音模型無法轉錄這段錄音。請確認所選模型已下載並就緒後，再次錄音。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The speech model isn’t ready. Open Model settings and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "語音模型尚未就緒。請開啟「模型」設定後再試一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The temporary upload directory already exists or is outside the staging root.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上傳暫存目錄已存在，或位於暫存根目錄之外。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The test-audio address for %@ is invalid. Update ThinkAloud and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 的測試音訊位址無效。請更新 ThinkAloud 後再試一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The text is pasted into whatever app had focus.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字會貼入剛才使用中的 App。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The text was already inserted. ThinkAloud is retrying only the save.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字已插入。ThinkAloud 只會重試儲存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The transcript is on the clipboard. Paste it manually, or enable Accessibility in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "逐字稿已放在剪貼簿。請手動貼上，或在「設定」中啟用「輔助使用」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The transcript is still streaming and cannot be edited yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "逐字稿仍在串流中，目前無法編輯。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The transcript was copied for manual paste instead of being inserted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "逐字稿已複製供你手動貼上，並未直接插入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The transcript was inserted, but ThinkAloud couldn’t restore the previous clipboard contents.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "逐字稿已插入，但 ThinkAloud 無法還原先前的剪貼簿內容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The transcript wasn’t inserted. ThinkAloud is retrying only the dataset save; you can retry insertion after saving.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "逐字稿未插入。ThinkAloud 只會重試儲存至資料集；儲存後你可以再次嘗試插入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The upload couldn’t finish. Check your connection, repository access, and available storage, then try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上傳無法完成。請檢查網路連線、儲存庫存取權與可用儲存空間後再試一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The upload request is too large. Reduce the dataset size and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上傳要求過大。請縮小資料集後再試一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There are no records to delete.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沒有可刪除的紀錄。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There are no saved records to upload.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沒有可上傳的已儲存紀錄。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is no active recording to stop.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目前沒有可停止的錄音。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These are your current global shortcuts. They may share one key because each acts in a different popup state.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這些是目前的全域快捷鍵。它們可以共用同一按鍵，因為各自在不同的彈出視窗階段中生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ThinkAloud": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ThinkAloud"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ThinkAloud Couldn’t Start": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ThinkAloud 無法啟動"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ThinkAloud Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ThinkAloud 設定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ThinkAloud applies the selected visibility to new or existing repositories and verifies it before uploading files.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ThinkAloud 會將所選可見度套用至新的或既有的儲存庫，並在上傳檔案前確認設定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ThinkAloud could not compare %@ with the local dataset. The manifest and audio were left unchanged. %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "ThinkAloud could not compare %1$@ with the local dataset. The manifest and audio were left unchanged. %2$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ThinkAloud 無法比對 %@ 與本機資料集。復原資訊檔與音訊皆保持不變。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ThinkAloud could not complete %@ because record %@ is not in the local dataset.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "ThinkAloud could not complete %1$@ because record %2$@ is not in the local dataset."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ThinkAloud 無法完成 %@，因為本機資料集中沒有紀錄 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ThinkAloud could not confirm whether the dataset deletion committed. Audio recovery was retained at %@; do not remove or change it. Reopen the app to retry reconciliation. %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "ThinkAloud could not confirm whether the dataset deletion committed. Audio recovery was retained at %1$@; do not remove or change it. Reopen the app to retry reconciliation. %2$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ThinkAloud 無法確認資料集刪除作業是否已提交。音訊復原資料保留在 %@；請勿移除或變更。請重新開啟 App 以重試復原。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ThinkAloud could not create the interrupted-save manifest at %@. No audio was written. %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "ThinkAloud could not create the interrupted-save manifest at %1$@. No audio was written. %2$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ThinkAloud 無法在 %@ 建立中斷儲存的復原資訊檔。未寫入任何音訊。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ThinkAloud could not inspect interrupted deletions in %@. Keep this folder unchanged and check its permissions before reopening the app. %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "ThinkAloud could not inspect interrupted deletions in %1$@. Keep this folder unchanged and check its permissions before reopening the app. %2$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ThinkAloud 無法檢查 %@ 中的中斷刪除作業。請保持此檔案夾原狀，並在重新開啟 App 前檢查其權限。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ThinkAloud could not inspect interrupted saves in %@. Keep this folder unchanged and check its permissions before reopening the app. %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "ThinkAloud could not inspect interrupted saves in %1$@. Keep this folder unchanged and check its permissions before reopening the app. %2$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ThinkAloud 無法檢查 %@ 中的中斷儲存作業。請保持此檔案夾原狀，並在重新開啟 App 前檢查其權限。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ThinkAloud could not remove the unsaved audio at %@. The recovery manifest was retained so Close or the next launch can retry. %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "ThinkAloud could not remove the unsaved audio at %1$@. The recovery manifest was retained so Close or the next launch can retry. %2$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ThinkAloud 無法移除 %@ 中未儲存的音訊。復原資訊檔已保留，因此「關閉」或下次啟動時可再次嘗試。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ThinkAloud could not restore %@ from interrupted deletion %@. Keep this folder unchanged and restore from backup or contact support. %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "ThinkAloud could not restore %1$@ from interrupted deletion %2$@. Keep this folder unchanged and restore from backup or contact support. %3$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ThinkAloud 無法還原 %@；中斷刪除的復原目錄為 %@。請保持該目錄原狀，並從備份還原或聯絡支援人員。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ThinkAloud couldn’t access Application Support. Check available storage and folder permissions, then retry.": {
