    "ThinkAloud couldn’t read a file selected for upload. Restore the file or exclude audio, then try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ThinkAloud 無法讀取所選的上傳檔案。請還原檔案或排除音訊後再試一次。"
