    },
    "ThinkAloud couldn’t safely reconcile an interrupted dataset deletion. Its recovery files were left unchanged. Retry; if the problem continues, restore from backup or contact support.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ThinkAloud 無法安全完成中斷資料集刪除作業的復原。復原檔案保持不變。請重試；若問題持續，請從備份還原或聯絡支援人員。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ThinkAloud couldn’t safely reconcile an interrupted dataset save. Its recovery files and audio were left unchanged. Retry; if the problem continues, restore from backup or contact support.": {
