    "This adds a brief “Polishing…” step after dictation. It needs a downloaded model below. If refinement fails, ThinkAloud keeps the original transcript and shows the failure before insertion.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這會在口述後加入短暫的「潤飾中…」步驟，且需要下方已下載的模型。如果潤飾失敗，ThinkAloud 會保留原始逐字稿，並在插入前顯示錯誤。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This downloads the selected model now so your first transcription is instant.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "現在就下載所選模型，讓你第一次轉錄不需等待。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This model may need about %@ at peak for the temporary Hugging Face blob, installed snapshot, and safety margin, but only %@ is available. Continue downloading?": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "This model may need about %1$@ at peak for the temporary Hugging Face blob, installed snapshot, and safety margin, but only %2$@ is available. Continue downloading?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此模型在下載高峰可能需要約 %@，供 Hugging Face 暫存檔、已安裝快照與安全預留空間使用，但目前只有 %@ 可用。仍要繼續下載嗎？"
          }
