          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ThinkAloud stopped before inserting or saving because the speech model didn’t return a complete final result. Record again to create a complete session.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "語音模型未傳回完整的最終結果，因此 ThinkAloud 已在插入或儲存前停止。請重新錄音以建立完整的工作階段。"
